ES:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}¡Hola,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} {{TAG:0005:0000:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
¡No podías visitarnos en mejor
momento, {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!
Hoy es el solsticio de verano.{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
¡No se pondrá el sol hasta muy
tarde,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} así que aprovecha, compi!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Oh, salut,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} {{TAG:0005:0000:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
Hai scelto un giorno perfetto per
farci visita,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!
Oggi è il {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}solstizio d'estate{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
e sarà giorno fino a mooolto tardi.
{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}Resta con noi!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Thanks for coming to visit us,{{TAG:0007:0000:03000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0000:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Did you know that
today's the {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Summer Solstice{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}?
That means the sun will be out all
night.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0026:}}It's like all-you-can-play day,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Bizi ziyarete geldiğin için sağ ol,{{TAG:0007:0000:03000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0000:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Bugünün {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Yaz Gündönümü{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}
olduğunu biliyor muydun? Güneş bütün
gece gökyüzünde kalacak.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0026:}}Sanki “sınırsız
oyun günü” gibi,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Che bello che tu sia qui, {{TAG:0005:0000:}}!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:000B:}}Che strana una notte così piena
di luce! {{TAG:0003:0001:}}È davvero, davvero strano,{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0010:}}¡Ah!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0001:}}¡{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0000:}}!{{TAG:0007:0001:}} 
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Hoy es el solsticio de verano, {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
por eso todavía hace tantísimo sol. 
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Yo he aprovechado para lavar la
ropa,{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} ¡y ni te imaginas lo rápido
que se me ha secado, {{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!
